  'A Flipbook of twelve drawings with Onion skins on.': "Flipbook dua belas gambar dengan Onion skin menyala.", 'A title with Keyframes: ease out, ease in and out, and a custom overshoot.': "Judul dengan keyframe: ease out, ease in-out, dan overshoot kustom.",
